{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前，在第九屆中國國際進口博覽會上，一款能夠通過釋放電信號調節食慾的減肥手環吸引了不少關注。這款產品名為ObeEnd減肥手環，由越凡醫療旗下品牌舒樂定推出，外觀與普通智能手環並無太大區別。據央視新聞報道，這款手環可以通過釋放特定電信號控制食慾，幫佩戴者在不知不覺中少吃一點。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585446.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.661884+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:52:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"b30102c75df1d36f79a4d545b983e5335368b6cbef8b18f959aa9c17ac48fa4c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}